      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THERMAL IGNITION (7) finds it hard to break through. Hit the board with a minor placing last time when second (17.34) at this track. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from six attempts. Can find winning form. SAILAWAY GIN (3) flew the lids from out wide with an impressive turn of foot, going on to clock 17.34 when a neck winner over 300m at this track last time. Significant danger. ALLIE (8) was a winner (17.08) at this track two back but out of the placings last time when 7th there. Has a good record here at this journey. A big run wouldn't surprise. GUACAMOLE IRISH (1) did a good job to finish third last time out over 300m at this track (17.09) in a Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
